#: ../../source/templates_webflow.md:16
msgid "1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_webflow.md:18
msgid ""
"Webflow's website is a visually rich, tool-forward platform that "
"communicates \"design without code\" through clean white surfaces, the "
"signature Webflow Blue (`#146ef5`), and a rich secondary color palette "
"(purple, pink, green, orange, yellow, red). The custom WF Visual Sans "
"Variable font creates a confident, precise typographic system with weight"
" 600 for display and 500 for body."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_webflow.md:20
msgid "**Key Characteristics:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_webflow.md:21
msgid "White canvas with near-black (`#080808`) text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_webflow.md:22
msgid "Webflow Blue (`#146ef5`) as primary brand + interactive color"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_webflow.md:23
msgid "WF Visual Sans Variable — custom variable font with weight 500–600"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_webflow.md:24
msgid ""
"Rich secondary palette: purple `#7a3dff`, pink `#ed52cb`, green "
"`#00d722`, orange `#ff6b00`, yellow `#ffae13`, red `#ee1d36`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_webflow.md:25
msgid "Conservative 4px–8px border-radius — sharp, not rounded"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_webflow.md:26
msgid "Multi-layer shadow stacks (5-layer cascading shadows)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_webflow.md:27
msgid ""
"Uppercase labels: 10px–15px, weight 500–600, wide letter-spacing "
"(0.6px–1.5px)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_webflow.md:28
msgid "translate(6px) hover animation on buttons"
msgstr ""

